{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんにちは！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ブログ開いて下さりありがとうございます🐈‍⬛"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "櫻坂46 増本綺良です🌸"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "5/12.13"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "『14th Single BACKS LIVE!!』無事終了しました〜！✨️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "会場に足を運んで下さった皆さま、配信をご覧下さった皆さま、ありがとうございました🌸"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/images/14/cff/6c522ebcd6ed98358d1681c78c512.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "気づいたら早替え場の名札に可愛いシールついてた🍩"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "2人で駆け回りながら喜んだ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/images/14/cff/6c522ebcd6ed98358d1681c78c512-01.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "衣装めちゃめちゃ可愛い🌹"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/images/14/cff/6c522ebcd6ed98358d1681c78c512-02.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "前にも言った気がしますが、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ツーショットを撮るといつも初対面みたいな表情の写真になります"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/images/14/cff/6c522ebcd6ed98358d1681c78c512-03.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "毎日が特別なのに、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "何かに期待しながら生きるのは贅沢だと思います。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "けど、それを分かった上で私は期待してしまいます。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "傍にいるメンバーが、Buddiesが、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "期待以上の特別を何度も与えてくれたからです。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そんなことを思いながらパフォーマンスさせて頂きました🕊️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "『Nothing special』いい曲ですね☺️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/images/14/cff/6c522ebcd6ed98358d1681c78c512-04.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "れいなちゃん"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今回はMCがお隣さんなのでよく話しました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "隣じゃない時もいっぱいくっついてきた"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "リハの日、なぎちゃんと一緒に差し入れでアイスを買ってきてくれた救世主✨️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "生き返ったよ〜〜ありがとう🍨"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/images/14/cff/6c522ebcd6ed98358d1681c78c512-05.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "brea